    { "type": "text", "id": "progress_b_name",  "label": "Checkpoint B name",  "default": "Pick Colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "progress_c_name",  "label": "Checkpoint C name",  "default": "Select Garment" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "progress_d_name",  "label": "Checkpoint D name",  "default": "Place Order" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Video (shown in Section 1)" },
    { "type": "text",         "id": "video_url",              "label": "Video URL (MP4 from Shopify Files)", "info": "Upload to Shopify Files first, then paste the CDN URL." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "video_poster",           "label": "Video poster image (still shown before play)" },
    { "type": "checkbox",     "id": "show_video_placeholder", "label": "Show placeholder when no video URL", "default": true },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 1 — Intro · What is a QR Crest?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step1_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Begin Here" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step1_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "What is a QR Crest?" },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step1_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>A QR code in our minimalistic design palette creates a <strong>CREST</strong>. A crest begins as a QR code — but becomes something more.</p><p class=\"pull\">A crest is both functional and expressive. It scans instantly, yet it also signals identity, intention, and authorship.</p><p>As a crest, it becomes a mark — connecting your audience to what you choose, in a way that is deliberate and distinctly yours.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 2 — Intro · How your crest works" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step2_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Understanding the QR" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step2_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "How your crest works." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step2_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>Your crest QR is a scannable square that connects the physical world to digital information. When someone scans it with their phone camera, it instantly opens a link — no typing required.</p><p>That link can take them to a website, a video, contact information, social media — anything you choose.</p><p class=\"micro\">In short: wearing your QR turns your physical presence into an interactive access point.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 3 — Step A · Generate your QR" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step3_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Step A · Generate" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step3_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Generate your QR code." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step3_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>Decide where your crest will take your new audience, then head to the <strong>QR generator</strong>. Drop in the URL — portfolio, brand site, social, anywhere.</p><p class=\"micro\">Already have a QR code? Use the <strong>\"Already have a QR\"</strong> tab and upload yours instead.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 4 — Step B · Choose your colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step4_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Step B · Colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step4_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Choose your colour." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step4_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>Complete your crest with one of our <strong>Umbrlux Colour</strong> options. This becomes your signature mark.</p><p class=\"micro\">Don't worry — you can alternate colours later if you change your mind.</p><p class=\"vwala\">Voilà — you made your crest.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 5 — Step C · Select your garment" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step5_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Step C · Garment" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step5_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Select your garment." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step5_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>In the <strong>UMBRLUX Boutique</strong>, pick the garment that carries your crest. You can always revisit any step out of order to make a change.</p><p>Use our <strong>size chart</strong> to choose carefully — getting the right size matters.</p><p class=\"micro\">If your garment supports it, you can choose front, back, or both for placement. Want a different colour for this piece? Hit <strong>Edit Crest</strong>.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 6 — About · The Umbrlux Crest" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step6_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "The Umbrlux Crest" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step6_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "An integral part of every piece." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step6_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p>The UMBRLUX logo is built into every crest. Our brand is aligned with achievement — the exceptional, the refined, and the positive — while remaining grounded in humanity and inclusion.</p><p class=\"pull\">Our mission is guided by Carpe Diem — Latin for \"seize the day.\" It shapes everything we make: intention, presence, and forward momentum.</p><p>Each crest is presented in default sizes and placements that are both aesthetically and strategically selected — designed to attract attention with restraint.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 7 — Step D · Place your order" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step7_label",   "label": "Label",   "default": "Step D · Order" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step7_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Place your order." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "step7_body",    "label": "Body",    "default": "<p><strong>Click Place Order</strong> — your selection is added to the cart. <strong>Click Checkout</strong>, fill in your details, and <strong>click Place Order</strong> again to complete your purchase.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Section 8 — Review · Pre-production" },
